#: modules/critter/phrases.lua:144
msgid "Keep it going."
msgstr "继续保持。"

#: modules/critter/phrases.lua:178
msgid "Keep turning pages."
msgstr "继续翻页吧。"

#: modules/critter/phrases.lua:161
msgid "Keep your streak alive!"
msgstr "别让连续阅读断掉！"

#: screens/sui_menu.lua:2487
msgid ""
"Keeps the Home Screen in memory while you read, so closing a book returns to "
"it instantly instead of rebuilding it. Uses more RAM while a book is open."
msgstr ""
"阅读期间将主页保留在内存中，关闭书籍时可立即返回主页，而无需重新加载。打开书"
"籍期间会占用更多内存。"

#: modules/critter/voice_phrases.lua:114
msgid "Kindly. Don't get used to it."
